{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（26日）早上8時許，警方接獲一名男子報案，指妻子在東涌迎康街1號「昇薈」10座住所內暈倒。</p><p>47歲女事主陷於昏迷，由救護車送往北大嶼山醫院搶救後，證實不治。據了解，事主有身體病患紀錄；警方將安排驗屍確定死因。</p><figure><img alt=\"東涌「昇薈」一單位女住客暈倒，送院後不治。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220504/598485851659702272235610.jpeg/G-kvqTSCiNDCVRvjHViVsDIO3alXidPvYIQfa2CEH2s\"/><figcaption>東涌「昇薈」一單位女住客暈倒，送院後不治。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T06:42:05.623831+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T06:32:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T13:57:33.234980+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:35:30.024738+00:00","content_hash":"144c9aae8deaeb7f0201c55f93eaaaf38b316345670fbf40c2bd44042a761c5b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}